<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="<%= lang %>">
<%- include('head')-%>

<body onload="setOptionsValues()" vocab="http://schema.org/" typeof="WebPage" class="page-home">
  <%- include('header', { loginMigrationLoginLink, signInMenuLink })-%>
  <main property="mainContentOfPage" class="container">
    <div class="row profile">
      <div class="col-md-12">
        <h1 property="name" id="wb-cont">Sign-in migration test hub</h1>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>Use this page to launch repeatable sign-in and registration test flows.</p>

    <div class="row mrgn-tp-lg">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="well well-sm brdr-rds-0">
          <h2 class="h4 mrgn-tp-0">Flow A: GC Sign in + GCKey + Interac</h2>
          <p>This flow opens a dedicated Sign in/Register page and includes all three sign-in options in the next step.</p>
          <p class="mrgn-tp-md">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg btn-block p-sm-3 mya" href="<%= flowAllPageLink %>">
              <span class="h4">Open flow page</span>
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="well well-sm brdr-rds-0">
          <h2 class="h4 mrgn-tp-0">Flow B: GC Sign in + GCKey</h2>
          <p>This flow opens a dedicated Sign in/Register page and keeps only GC Sign in and GCKey.</p>
          <p class="mrgn-tp-md">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg btn-block p-sm-3 mya" href="<%= flowNoInteracPageLink %>">
              <span class="h4">Open flow page</span>
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-12">
        <div class="panel panel-info">
          <div class="panel-body">
            <h2 class="h4 mrgn-tp-0">Manual client selection</h2>
            <p>Need the original RP simulator client chooser? Open it directly:</p>
            <p class="mrgn-bttm-0">
              <a class="btn btn-default" href="<%= manualClientSelectionLink %>">
                Open RP simulator client picker
              </a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('preFooter')-%>
  </main>
  <%- include('footer')-%>
</body>
</html>
